  flagsOnComplete: []
  stepText:
  - Teach Pell's lantern the lane to Xylos
  - Take the Xylos warp off Tallow's approach
  - Cut Teo Marrow's seed barges free of the snagvine
  - Follow the delta beacon down to Rootmarket
  - Take the mooring line, then hear Ruva Okh out
  - Open the middle sluice on the Braided River's north bank
  - Relieve the crew shut inside Marrow-1, on the first island
  - Relieve the crew shut inside Marrow-2, on the second island
  - Open the south sluice to reach Seedfall bank
  - Drive the Seedthane off Marrow-3
  - Ask Teo Marrow what still blocks the crossing
  - Work the Walking Canopy's anchor roots to reach its basin
  - Stop the Floodcrown holding the basin's flood gates
  - Tell Ruva Okh the crossing is open, and hear the vote
